Guard GPU metrics until their first sample is available.

Apple Silicon may not provide utilization or power in the initial IOReport
sample. Keep rendering the available metrics and resume the missing metrics
when samples arrive, instead of calling back() on an empty deque. Also avoid
showing the zero temperature placeholder as a valid sensor reading.

Regression tests cover missing utilization, memory, power, and all samples
in both the CPU summary and dedicated GPU panel, followed by data arrival.

Upstream issue: https://github.com/aristocratos/btop/issues/1716

